+/* v4.0.1 pre-footer alignment fix.
+   - .amp-trust / .amp-ga used "margin: X 0 0 !important", which beat the constrained layout's
+     "margin-inline: auto !important", so above ~1336px they hugged the left padding instead of centering.
+     (Fixed in place above with "auto".)
